# Exclude dependency and build outputs from Docker context
**/node_modules
**/.next
**/.next*
**/dist
**/build
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/.vercel

# Git and editor junk
.git
.gitignore
.vscode
npm-debug.log*
yarn-error.log*
pnpm-debug.log*
.DS_Store

# Local env and runtime files
.env*
*.local
tmp
tmp/**
**/tmp
**/tmp/**
logs

# Next.js dev caches (should never be shipped)
apps/web/tmp/**
